msgstr "qubes-schema-v2.png"

#: ../../../developer/system/architecture.rst:10
#: 73b0071920c54c79b354b8e92675d647
msgid ""
"Qubes lets the user define many secure compartments known as :term:`qubes "
"<qube>`, which are implemented as lightweight :term:`virtual machines (VMs)  "
"<vm>`. For example, the user can have “personal,” “work,” “shopping,” "
"“bank,” and “random” app qubes and can use the applications within those "
"qubes just as if they were executing on the local machine. At the same time, "
"however, these applications are well isolated from each other. Qubes also "
"supports secure copy-and-paste and file sharing between qubes, of course."
msgstr ""
"Qubes 讓使用者定義許多稱為 :term:`qube <qube>` 的安全隔離區，這些隔離區實作為"
"輕量級\\ :term:`虛擬機器 (VM) <vm>`\\ 。例如，使用者可以擁有「個人」、「工"
"作」、「購物」、「銀行」和「隨機」應用程式 qube，並且可以像在本機機器上執行一"
"樣，在這些 qube 中使用應用程式。然而，這些應用程式彼此之間是良好隔離的。"
"Qubes 當然也支援 qube 之間的安全複製貼上與檔案共享。"

#: ../../../developer/system/architecture.rst:13
#: 6c601ee569ba48bbac2f37582180a389
msgid "Key architecture features"
msgstr "主要架構特性"

#: ../../../developer/system/architecture.rst:16
#: e0331e55b69b46f3a915eeb93067fcbc
msgid "Based on a secure bare-metal hypervisor (Xen)"
msgstr "基於安全的裸機 Hypervisor（Xen）"

#: ../../../developer/system/architecture.rst:18
#: 253c533865fe46c78adde088d101306f
msgid "Networking code sand-boxed in an unprivileged VM (using IOMMU/VT-d)"
msgstr "網路程式碼在無特權的 VM 中進行沙盒化（使用 IOMMU/VT-d）"

#: ../../../developer/system/architecture.rst:20
#: 3e1cdb1c6a43497b93f949eb5c0e0002
msgid ""
"USB stacks and drivers sand-boxed in an unprivileged VM (currently "
"experimental feature)"
msgstr "USB 堆疊與驅動程式在無特權的 VM 中進行沙盒化（目前為實驗性功能）"

#: ../../../developer/system/architecture.rst:22
#: cdd678d521114332a8d109f452dc341a
msgid "No networking code in the privileged domain (dom0)"
msgstr "特權域（dom0）中沒有網路程式碼"

#: ../../../developer/system/architecture.rst:24
#: 5189453f1f734a5b89c4abdd907639f2
msgid ""
"All user applications run in “app qubes,” lightweight VMs based on Linux"
msgstr ""
"所有使用者應用程式都在「應用程式 qube」中執行，這些是基於 Linux 的輕量級 VM"

#: ../../../developer/system/architecture.rst:26
#: 46fe72ee37a243dfaf2086b0c7c3918c
msgid "Centralized updates of all app qubes based on the same template"
msgstr "基於相同範本集中更新所有應用程式 qube"

