#: ../../../developer/system/architecture.rst:39
#: 75c502b7d4714a42bb835f82918233d0
msgid "Qubes Core Stack"
msgstr "Qubes 核心堆疊"

#: ../../../developer/system/architecture.rst:42
#: c24ae02c91064b3ea92a99ab990d9e6e
msgid ""
"Qubes Core Stack is, as the name implies, the core component of Qubes OS. "
"It’s the glue that connects all the other components together, and which "
"allows users and admins to interact with and configure the system. The other "
"components of the Qubes system include:"
msgstr ""
"Qubes Core Stack，顧名思義，是 Qubes OS 的核心組件。它是將所有其他組件連接在"
"一起的黏合劑，並允許使用者和管理員與系統互動及進行配置。Qubes 系統的其他組件"
"包括："

#: ../../../developer/system/architecture.rst:44
#: 79d35349d2114d12a13cf8b292911d2b
msgid ""
"VM-located core agents (implementing e.g. qrexec endpoints used by various "
"Qubes services)"
msgstr ""
"\"\"位於 VM 中的核心代理程式（實作例如各種 Qubes 服務所使用的 qrexec 端點）"

#: ../../../developer/system/architecture.rst:46
#: 9a6f9260515e4d588e0065dd743ce29f
msgid ""
"VM-customizations (making the VMs lightweight and working well with seamless "
"GUI virtualization)"
msgstr "VM 自訂化（使 VM 輕量化並與無縫 GUI 虛擬化良好配合）"

#: ../../../developer/system/architecture.rst:48
#: eb217b75e02e450faab043416ce1a4a9
msgid ""
"Qubes GUI virtualization (the protocol, VM-located agents, and daemons "
"located in the GUI domain which, for now, happens to be the same as dom0),"
msgstr ""
"Qubes GUI 虛擬化（協定、位於 VM 中的代理程式，以及位於 GUI 領域中的守護進程"
"（目前恰好與 dom0 相同）），"

#: ../../../developer/system/architecture.rst:50
#: b2e9e36d4fea4a009f87c729e2080e76
msgid ""
"GUI domain customizations (Desktop Environment customizations, decoration "
"coloring plugin, etc)"
msgstr "GUI 域自訂化（桌面環境自訂化、裝飾著色外掛等）"

#: ../../../developer/system/architecture.rst:52
#: b07e5369676a440b84d5219df2333f2d
msgid ""
"The admin qube distribution (various customizations, special services, such "
"as for receiving and verifying updates, in the future: custom distro)"
msgstr ""
"管理 qube 散佈版（各種自訂化、特殊服務，例如接收和驗證更新，未來：自訂散佈"
"版）"

#: ../../../developer/system/architecture.rst:54
#: 2f60f8c365644a22b076cbcf38a47db9
msgid ""
"The Xen hypervisor (with a bunch of customization patches, occasional "
"hardening) or - in the future - some other virtualising or containerizing "
"software or technology"
msgstr ""
"Xen Hypervisor（附帶大量自訂修補程式、偶爾的強化措施）或——未來——某些其他虛擬"
"化或容器化軟體或技術"

#: ../../../developer/system/architecture.rst:56
#: 2f6f0c67e8604cd6be0ee559a5a6a83a
msgid ""
"Multiple “Qubes Apps” (various services built on top of Qubes qrexec "
"infrastructure, such as: trusted PDF and Image converters, Split GPG, safe "
"USB proxies for HID devices, USB proxy for offering USB devices (exposed via "
"qvm-usb), Yubikey support, USB Armory support, etc)"
msgstr ""
"多種「Qubes 應用程式」（建構在 Qubes qrexec 基礎設施之上的各種服務，例如：可"
"信賴的 PDF 和圖片轉換器、Split GPG、用於 HID 裝置的安全 USB 代理、用於提供 "
"USB 裝置的 USB 代理（透過 qvm-usb 暴露）、Yubikey 支援、USB Armory 支援等）"

#: ../../../developer/system/architecture.rst:58
#: 59e855b005e64e07b38046ff2e47197f
msgid ""
"Various ready-to-use templates (e.g. Debian-, Whonix-based), which are used "
"to create actual VMs, i.e. provide the root filesystem to the VMs"
msgstr ""
"各種立即可用的範本（例如基於 Debian、Whonix），用於建立實際的 VM，即提供 VM "
"的根檔案系統"

